<title>TAIWAN: Earthquake shakes Taiwan capital Taipei.</title>
<headline>Earthquake shakes Taiwan capital Taipei.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>A moderate earthquake struck northern Taiwan on Tuesday, shaking office buildings in the capital Taipei.</p>
<p>There were no immediate reports of damage or injuries and the magnitude was not immediately known.  </p>
<p>Earthquakes are relatively common in Taiwan and rarely cause severe damage.</p>
</text>
